      "settings": {
        "subheading": "",
        "title": "",
        "content": "<p>I have been working with William Wood for almost 2 years and truly value the partnership we have created. I am proud to showcase their products and watching them expand their product lines has been amazing. I can’t wait to see what’s next for the brand.  From Instagram collaborations, to location shoots and PR events, every encounter is fun, enjoyable and rewarding.  The team are always on hand to answer any queries and are flexible with timescales when I have to juggle work. William Wood are a wonderful company who truly value their customers and brand ambassadors. </p><p><strong>A pleasure to work with.</strong></p><p></p><p>@homedesign.meadowview</p>",
